         How the list was made.  The recipe pins no Hackage index state
         and has no freeze file, so the plan was solved with the pinned
         toolchain (wasm32-wasi-cabal 3.14.2.0, GHC 9.10.3.20250924) at
         index state 2026-08-31T23:24:32Z, the time the binary was
         committed; any index state from 2026-08-29T13:20:56Z (the last
         upload among the planned packages) to then gives the same plan.
         Checked against the binary: its strings carry 57 unit ids (35
         with a content hash, which fixes the package's source, flags and
         dependencies), every one of them in the plan, and none
         disagreeing.  24 Hackage packages are not confirmed by the
         binary, though their versions follow from the same plan:
         ansi-terminal, ansi-terminal-types, ap-normalize, base-compat,
         base64-bytestring, blaze-html, case-insensitive, colour,
         data-hash, enummapset, filemanip, generic-data, gitrev,
