9.  The Agda mark: favicon.svg and favicon.png

    plfa-playground's adaptation of Agda's official mark,
    doc/user-manual/agda.svg in https://github.com/agda/agda, designed by
    Miëtek Bak.  The mark ships in the Agda package as one of its
